  "question": {
    "text": "Lines are drawn parallel to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units&nbsp; from the origin. Then which one of the following points lies on any of these lines?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "3RZkf",
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
