  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The equation of a line parallel to the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Thus, the equation of a line parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>The distance of a line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;from origin is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Given the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units from origin</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Hence, the equation of the lines are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Clearly point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfy the given equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
